<http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/20000823> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Team ball game that opposes two teams of 11 that have offence and defence sections. Each offence attempts to move an oval ball down the 120 yards long field. Points are scored by advancing the ball into the opposing team s end zone."@en-gb <http://cv.iptc.org/newscodes/mediatopic/> .
